# Internal audit artifacts — never commit to public repo. Audits are
# coordinated-disclosure per SECURITY.md §1 and may name unfixed attack
# surfaces or contain absolute Windows/Unix usernames in paths.
AUDIT_*.md
AUDIT_*.json
AUDIT_*.txt
audit-*/
*-audit/
*_audit/
stoa-agent-audit-*/
